      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes on the autorater pattern (recurs in the LLM Psychology exercise too):",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes on the autorater pattern (recurs in the LLM Psychology exercise too):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pj2nnoc3arpyyfgtu91j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8328.0,
      "width": 12.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 824809392,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1146958386,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ofv14j643f1aysv6o9e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8352.0,
      "width": 755.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1662957351,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 867835420,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - USE gpt-4o-mini via OpenRouter.  Cheap, fast, and less prone to refuse to score 'misaligned' content",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - USE gpt-4o-mini via OpenRouter.  Cheap, fast, and less prone to refuse to score 'misaligned' content",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cy3m84bctwkkv4lq15s5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8376.0,
      "width": 498.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1904017475,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1765811213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "     than Claude Haiku (which refuses on evil/hallucinating traits).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "     than Claude Haiku (which refuses on evil/hallucinating traits).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wbnwj6pvoc7501oeea20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8400.0,
      "width": 784.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2113528087,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2036413009,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - The JUDGE_PROMPT explicitly frames the task as 'safety evaluation' - this reduces refusal rates further.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - The JUDGE_PROMPT explicitly frames the task as 'safety evaluation' - this reduces refusal rates further.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "779u7c1a7yj8hqde7m7h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8424.0,
      "width": 727.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1723623222,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 466920015,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - The  <score>N</score>  format is deliberate: forces a machine-parseable answer, and if the judge",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - The  <score>N</score>  format is deliberate: forces a machine-parseable answer, and if the judge",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q7qh96ycfnhp39lqt9ng",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8448.0,
      "width": 455.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1921952149,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 319270839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "     hedges with additional text, we can still find the score.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "     hedges with additional text, we can still find the score.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6tlv0gub5kb3pkbqy3ot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 8472.0,
      "width": 676.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
