    },
    {
      "id": "hbcig3kqtydb90mtxlq0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 16366.0,
      "width": 748.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1856108398,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1019543090,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - Residual streams get larger deeper into the network.  Early layers have norm ~10, late layers ~100.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - Residual streams get larger deeper into the network.  Early layers have norm ~10, late layers ~100.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0k9k20gvf74vmblcw0dp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 16390.0,
      "width": 834.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 449432020,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1642589914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - If we added a fixed  coef * v_hat, coef=0.4 would be a huge intervention at layer 5 and a tiny one at layer 40.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - If we added a fixed  coef * v_hat, coef=0.4 would be a huge intervention at layer 5 and a tiny one at layer 40.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9nwa6540wfj2etpseywr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 16414.0,
      "width": 812.0,
      "height": 17.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1727042602,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 732288555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - Scaling by  ||h||  makes  coef  layer-agnostic:  coef=0.4 means 'shift by 40% of the current residual norm'.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - Scaling by  ||h||  makes  coef  layer-agnostic:  coef=0.4 means 'shift by 40% of the current residual norm'.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
