      "text": "Coherence judge:  the ESSENTIAL adversarial check for steering experiments",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 27,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Coherence judge:  the ESSENTIAL adversarial check for steering experiments",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7zrtqj8cw8n57ple0ewr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 16812.0,
      "width": 1050.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1104544861,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1437290094,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steering can produce GIBBERISH that superficially looks 'misaligned' because the misalignment judge sees weird tokens.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steering can produce GIBBERISH that superficially looks 'misaligned' because the misalignment judge sees weird tokens.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iwml12p5wpvi06b8msg4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 16840.0,
      "width": 1059.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1700818120,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 823221770,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Run a SECOND autorater that scores coherence 0-100.  Drop any response with coherence < 50 before scoring misalignment.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Run a SECOND autorater that scores coherence 0-100.  Drop any response with coherence < 50 before scoring misalignment.",
