      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Stack all 167 B vectors as an (167, 5120) matrix.  Fit  PCA(n_components=2).  Plot the projected points colored by step.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
