      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steering can produce gibberish that reads as 'misaligned' to a naive judge. Score BOTH the target concept and",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steering can produce gibberish that reads as 'misaligned' to a naive judge. Score BOTH the target concept and",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vjc8xtsffn9s0ayrnr21",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1010.6666666666666,
      "y": 31579.296179837685,
      "width": 713.0,
      "height": 14.0,
      "angle": 0,
